    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d211">

                <pb facs="0593" n="565" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v20/pg565"/>

                <head>211. Telegram From the Department of State to the
                        Embassy in the United Kindom<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d211-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1957-05-30T11:06:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 30,
                                1957—11:06 a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8377. For Stassen From Acting Secretary. I
                    trust we shall receive promptly the revised basic paper incorporating May 25
                    decisions which you discussed with Secretary on Sunday.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d211-f2"/> President expects this to be agreed by interested
                    agencies here and then submitted to him before you undertake detailed
                    negotiations based on the revised policy.<anchor n="3" xml:id="d211-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                            >Herter</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
